---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const newsletterEnabled = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_NEWSLETTER_ENABLED === "true";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Roberto Mora, the platform engineer and Engineering Manager writing convoluted.io."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 pt-12 pb-20">
    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="mb-12 flex items-start justify-between gap-8 max-[520px]:flex-col-reverse">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <span class="mb-3 block font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.08em] text-muted uppercase">About</span>
        <h1 class="mb-1.5 font-serif text-[3rem] leading-[1.08] font-medium tracking-[-0.025em] text-ink-900">Roberto Mora</h1>
        <p class="mb-5 font-mono text-sm text-green-700">
          Platform Engineering · Costa Rica · @romogo17
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.72] text-body">
          When I was eight, an older cousin moved in with us to start a degree
          in Information Systems Engineering, and I got hooked watching what she
          did at the computer. Ten years later I enrolled in the same degree.
          These days I'm an Engineering Manager at Experian, which I joined out
          of a graduate program and where I've worked my way up to be an
          engineering leader.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.72] text-body">
          I write convoluted.io to understand things better by writing them
          down, and to teach. I was a TA in university and I've missed it. I
          treat the writing, and the work behind it, as a craft: I'm after
          excellence rather than perfection, giving the best I have to whatever
          I'm working on.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex size-20 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green-100 font-mono text-xl font-bold text-green-800" aria-hidden="true">RM</div>
    </section>

    <hr class="mb-10 border-none border-t border-paper-300" />

    <!-- Now -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink-900">Now</h2>
      <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-body">
        When I'm not managing a platform team or writing here, I'm most likely
        on a padel court. That's the real obsession, with some tennis on the
        side. I read, I train a lot, and I hike whenever I can; Costa Rica is
        generous with trails. Last year I finished a master's in AI, mostly to
        understand it from the inside. Pura vida isn't just a slogan here, and I
        try to bring a bit of it to the writing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Topics -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink-900">What I write about</h2>
      <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-col gap-2.5 p-0">
        <li class="relative pl-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-body before:absolute before:left-0 before:font-semibold before:text-green-500 before:content-['→']">
          <strong>Platform engineering</strong>: the developer-experience layer
          and the SRE mindset
        </li>
        <li class="relative pl-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-body before:absolute before:left-0 before:font-semibold before:text-green-500 before:content-['→']">
          <strong>Distributed systems</strong>: system design and reasoning
          about complexity
        </li>
        <li class="relative pl-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-body before:absolute before:left-0 before:font-semibold before:text-green-500 before:content-['→']">
          <strong>Containers and orchestration</strong>: Kubernetes and the
          machinery around it
        </li>
        <li class="relative pl-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-body before:absolute before:left-0 before:font-semibold before:text-green-500 before:content-['→']">
          <strong>Databases</strong>, PostgreSQL first: internals, extensions,
          the parts people skip
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink-900">Elsewhere</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/romogo17"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-paper-300 px-3.5 py-2 font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-body no-underline transition-[border-color,color,background] duration-150 ease-brand hover:border-green-500 hover:bg-surface-sunken hover:text-ink-900 hover:no-underline"
        >
          <svg
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><path
              d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.44-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.45v6.29zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.55V9h3.57v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.72v20.56C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.72V1.72C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/romogo17"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          target="_blank"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-paper-300 px-3.5 py-2 font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-body no-underline transition-[border-color,color,background] duration-150 ease-brand hover:border-green-500 hover:bg-surface-sunken hover:text-ink-900 hover:no-underline"
        >
          <svg
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><path
              d="M12 .5C5.37.5 0 5.78 0 12.29c0 5.2 3.44 9.6 8.2 11.16.6.11.82-.25.82-.56v-1.96c-3.34.72-4.04-1.6-4.04-1.6-.55-1.37-1.33-1.74-1.33-1.74-1.09-.74.08-.73.08-.73 1.2.09 1.83 1.23 1.83 1.23 1.07 1.82 2.81 1.3 3.5.99.1-.77.42-1.3.76-1.6-2.67-.3-5.47-1.32-5.47-5.87 0-1.3.47-2.36 1.24-3.19-.13-.3-.54-1.52.11-3.18 0 0 1.01-.32 3.3 1.22a11.5 11.5 0 0 1 6 0c2.29-1.54 3.3-1.22 3.3-1.22.65 1.66.24 2.88.12 3.18.77.83 1.23 1.89 1.23 3.19 0 4.56-2.81 5.57-5.49 5.86.43.37.82 1.1.82 2.22v3.29c0 .32.21.69.82.57A12.02 12.02 0 0 0 24 12.29C24 5.78 18.63.5 12 .5Z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:romogo17@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-paper-300 px-3.5 py-2 font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-body no-underline transition-[border-color,color,background] duration-150 ease-brand hover:border-green-500 hover:bg-surface-sunken hover:text-ink-900 hover:no-underline">
          <svg
            width="16"
            height="16"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path
              d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path></svg
          >
          Email
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    {
      newsletterEnabled && (
        <section id="subscribe" class="mb-10">
          <h2 class="mb-3.5 font-serif text-2xl font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-ink-900">Subscribe</h2>
          <p class="mb-[18px] text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.6] text-body">
            New posts by email, about twice a month. No spam, unsubscribe
            anytime.
          </p>
          <form
            class="flex max-w-[420px] gap-2 max-[520px]:flex-col"
            action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/convoluted.io"
            method="post"
            data-newsletter
          >
            <div class="relative flex flex-1 items-center">
              <svg
                width="16"
                height="16"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                class="absolute left-3 shrink-0 pointer-events-none text-faint"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2" />
                <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7" />
              </svg>
              <input
                type="email"
                name="email"
                placeholder="you@domain.dev"
                aria-label="Email address"
                class="h-10 w-full rounded-md border-[1.5px] border-paper-400 bg-surface-raised pr-3 pl-[38px] font-sans text-sm text-body transition-[border-color,box-shadow] duration-150 ease-brand focus:border-accent focus:shadow-focus focus:outline-none"
                required
              />
            </div>
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="h-10 rounded-md border-none bg-accent px-[18px] font-sans text-sm font-semibold whitespace-nowrap text-paper-50 transition-[background,transform] duration-150 ease-brand hover:bg-accent-hover active:translate-y-px max-[520px]:w-full"
            >Subscribe</button>
          </form>
          <p
            class="mt-3 mb-0 min-h-[1.2em] font-mono text-[12.5px] text-faint empty:hidden data-[state=success]:text-green-700 data-[state=error]:text-[#c0392b]"
            data-newsletter-status
            role="status"
            aria-live="polite"
          />
        </section>
      )
    }
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import "../scripts/newsletter";
</script>
